  "description": "A well presented two-bedroom ground floor apartment with a private terrace.\n\nMorrison Estates is delighted to present this attractive two-bedroom apartment, ideally situated beside Citywest Shopping Centre. Offering spacious accommodation and a convenient ground floor setting, this lovely property combines comfortable living with an excellent location.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall leading to a large living and dining area, with direct access to a terrace providing a welcome outdoor space. A modern kitchen complements the living accommodation.\n\nThere are two double bedrooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from an ensuite shower room. A separate main bathroom completes the layout.\nWith Citywest Shopping Centre beside the development, shops, cafés and everyday amenities are conveniently close at hand. This is an appealing opportunity to rent a well presented apartment in a popular and accessible location.\n\nFeatures\n\n•\tWell presented ground floor apartment\n•\tSpacious living and dining area opening onto a terrace\n•\tModern kitchen\n•\tTwo double bedrooms\n•\tPrincipal bedroom with ensuite\n•\tSeparate main bathroom\n•\tExcellent location beside Citywest Shopping Centre\n\nViewing by appointment.\n\n\n",
